			"Message": "chore(deps): Update GitHub Actions and submodules\n\nThis commit updates the GitHub Actions workflow file (.github/workflows/Auto.yml) to use newer versions of the actions:\n- `actions/checkout` updated from v4.2.2 to v6.0.1\n- `ad-m/github-push-action` updated from v0.8.0 to v1.0.0\n\nAdditionally, all submodules have been updated to their latest commits on the 'Current' branch. These repositories include:\n- Document\n- Maintain\n- Mountain\n- Rest\n- River\n- SideCar\n- Sun\n\nEach submodule now points to the most recent merge commit from its respective repository's 'Current' branch, ensuring that the project is using the latest shared codebase components.",
